 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS: 剪定不要。stauden.de・種: 秋に茎を切る。MBG「ときにやや invasively に広がる」、Gaißmayer「強く走出枝を出すので慎重に使う」、RHS「厄介になりうる」とあり E との境目。どれも控えめな書き方なので クルマバソウと同じ扱いで A にした",
  "management_type_quote": "it will often spread, albeit somewhat invasively at times, by creeping roots, self-seeding or stem-rooting",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/種] Best in part shade in hot summer climates.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or North-facing or East-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／RHS・品種] spreads freely with the potential to become a nuisance; [MBG・種] somewhat invasively at times, by creeping roots（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 2／MBG・種] will often spread ... by creeping roots, self-seeding or stem-rooting（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] Prefers moist soils where it will often spread, albeit somewhat invasively at times, by creeping roots, self-seeding or stem-rooting where the stems touch the ground.\n[地下茎 2／MBG・種] Noteworthy Characteristics Galium verum , commonly called yellow bedstraw, is a rhizomatous, somewhat weedy perennial herb that typically grows to 8-30\" tall and to 36\" wide on erect to sprawling stems.\n[地下茎の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 3 相当\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 1、文を読み直して 2（[MBG・種] will often spread ... by creeping roots, self-seeding or stem-rooting）\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 地下茎：言い回しの照合では 2、文を読み直して 3（[RHS・品種] spreads freely with the potential to become a nuisance; [MBG・種] somewhat invasively at times, by creeping roots）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：ランナー）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[管理タイプの見直し] 文を読んで隔離推奨型にしなかったので、侵略的 から 強い に下げた\n[ユーザーの決定 2026-11-24] 読み直しで段階 3（[MBG・種] somewhat invasively / Somewhat weedy）。植物の性質として書かれているので 侵略的・隔離推奨型",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Matforming",
